@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<section class="hero" style="max-width: 900px; margin-inline: auto;">
    <h2>Hi, I'm Justin Marshall</h2>

    <p class="hero__description" style="max-width: 10000px;">
        A Software developer with 8 years experience developing applications in the FinTech and Telecoms space. 
        My weapons of choice are .NET, Javascript, SQL, Docker and Kubernetes to name a few, and I am interested 
        in designing software that is intuitive to use, performant, secure, and AI native. In my career so far I've been 
        fortunate to work on varied projects like a JIRA service management call centre integration, a UI rewrite 
        for an OpenBanking integration, Decision Engines for credit applications, writing a custom Data Access 
        Layer using .NET, integrating ArgoCD gitops workflows into our dev/QA processes, and implementing Github 
        Actions to run automated test suites to provide fast feedback.

        For years I've wanted to maintain a blog app so that I could record my technical achievements in one place, 
        and this is my first attempt at doing so. I hope to write about the things I've learned in my career so far, 
        and the things I learn in the future, and I hope that you find it useful.
    </p>

